   946  /* Tuples {{{2
   947   *
   948   * Since tuples can contain a mix of variable- and fixed-sized items,
   949   * they are, in terms of serialization, a hybrid of variable-sized and
   950   * fixed-sized arrays.
   951   *
   952   * Offsets are only stored for variable-sized items.  Also, since the
